{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Campfire 是一款專為面對面社交設計的離線派對遊戲應用，無需 WiFi、行動數據或註冊帳號，只需透過 Bluetooth 連接即可與朋友一同遊玩。它非常適合露營、公路旅行或訊號不佳的聚會場合，現正限時免費提供下載。</p>\n\n<h2>無網路多人互動遊戲</h2>\n<p>用戶可作為主機分享四位數代碼，其他人無需下載 App 即可加入。內含四款離線遊戲：AI 生成題目但完全離線的Trivia、查看群體選擇分佈的Would You Rather、測試友誼默契的How Well Do You Know Me，以及經典的Two Truths and a Lie。設計旨在讓玩家放下手機專注於現實互動，無廣告且保護隱私。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1287-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1288-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1289-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1290-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1291-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1292-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Campfire: Offline Party Games</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T03:58:54.521803+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}